<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-SATURDAY'S SCHEDULE OF MATCHES AT THE FRENCH OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SATURDAY'S SCHEDULE OF MATCHES AT THE FRENCH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of matches at the French Open tennis championships on Saturday (play starts 1230GMT, prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Centre court</p>
<p>Women's singles final: 1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v 9-Iva Majoli (Croatia)</p>
<p>Men's doubles final: 1-Todd Woodbridge/Mark Woodforde (Australia) v 4-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia)/Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>Mixed doubles final: 1-Lisa Raymond/Patrick Galbraith (U.S.) v 16-Rika Hiraki (Japan)/Mahesh Bhupathi (India)</p>
</text>
